# Mudi POS (মুদি POS)

This repo contains **Mudi POS** — a simple Bengali grocery store POS.

## Must read first
- `MUDI_POS.md` — full feature list and file map
- `mudi-pos.project.json` — machine-readable project manifest

## Entry point
- **URL:** `/pos`
- **Page:** `src/app/pos/page.tsx`
- **Main component:** `src/components/mudidokan/MudidokanPos.tsx`

## Code layout (do not mix with BloodLink/Fashion)
- Logic: `src/lib/mudidokan/`
- UI: `src/components/mudidokan/`
- Data: browser `localStorage` key `mudidokan-pos-v2` — no server DB

## Conventions
- UI language: **Bangla**
- Currency: **৳ (BDT)**
- Weight input: **grams** (user types grams; price per kg/liter)
- Admin tabs (পণ্য, হিসাব): password `1234` by default
- Keep POS changes scoped to `mudidokan` paths unless user asks otherwise

## When user says "Mudi POS" / "মুদি POS"
They mean this project at `/pos`, not BloodLink or Fashion shop features.
